Round 3 fixes every P0-P2 and P3 of the round-2 review in lib/watchsvc.sh, lib/supervise.sh and lib/stopguard.sh, each with a regression test (tests/test_watchsvc.sh: 74 pass; against the round-2 code 26 fail).
The stop guard never starts a watcher; it tells the agent to ask the user to run `watcher install`. Waking needs tmux or OSRC_WATCH_DELIVER_CMD; otherwise the guard keeps asking for supervise. The tmux wake has an end-to-end fake-pane test.
Removed: resume channel, `watcher tick`, --transient, OSRC_WATCH_TMUX.
